{"seq":3,"slug":"five-connectivity","title":"五通：一个有依赖顺序的合作操作系统","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/strategic-vision/five-connectivity","wordCount":2365,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"五通-一个有依赖顺序的合作操作系统\">五通：一个有依赖顺序的合作操作系统</h1><p>把&quot;政策沟通、设施联通、贸易畅通、资金融通、民心相通&quot;当成五个并列的 KPI 清单，是最常见也最有害的读法——它解释不了为什么有的国家签了文件十年仍无项目落地，也解释不了为什么设施联通总是先行。五通的内部其实存在严格的依赖顺序：政策互信是许可，基础设施是载体，贸易流量是回报，融资安排是血液，民心是维护成本的决定项。本篇从文本考据与经济学模型两个方向拆解这个&quot;操作系统&quot;的架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[政策沟通&lt;br/&gt;许可层] --&gt; B[设施联通&lt;br/&gt;载体层]&#10;    B --&gt; C[贸易畅通&lt;br/&gt;回报层]&#10;    B --&gt; D[资金融通&lt;br/&gt;血液层]&#10;    C --&gt; E[民心相通&lt;br/&gt;维护层]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E -.-&gt;|反馈:社会接受度| A\">graph TB\n    A[政策沟通&lt;br/&gt;许可层] --&gt; B[设施联通&lt;br/&gt;载体层]\n    B --&gt; C[贸易畅通&lt;br/&gt;回报层]\n    B --&gt; D[资金融通&lt;br/&gt;血液层]\n    C --&gt; E[民心相通&lt;br/&gt;维护层]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E -.-&gt;|反馈:社会接受度| A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>依赖关系</th>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n<th>可核查锚点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>政策沟通</td>\n<td>无前置</td>\n<td>战略对接落空</td>\n<td>双边合作文件（截至 2023 年 6 月 150 多国签署）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设施联通</td>\n<td>需要政策许可</td>\n<td>建成后利用率不足</td>\n<td>中欧班列、中老铁路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贸易畅通</td>\n<td>依赖设施与通关</td>\n<td>关税降了物流没跟上</td>\n<td>RCEP 原产地累积规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金融通</td>\n<td>依赖项目现金流</td>\n<td>债务不可持续</td>\n<td>亚投行、丝路基金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>民心相通</td>\n<td>依赖前四者的日常体验</td>\n<td>项目遭社区抵制</td>\n<td>鲁班工坊等培训项目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"文本考据-初版措辞与定稿的差异携带信息\">文本考据：初版措辞与定稿的差异携带信息</h2><p>对照两次原始演讲可以精确追踪框架的演化。2013 年 9 月 7 日纳扎尔巴耶夫大学演讲提出的五通是&quot;政策沟通、道路联通、贸易畅通、货币流通、民心相通&quot;；2015 年 3 月 28 日发布的《推动共建丝绸之路经济带和21世纪海上丝绸之路的愿景与行动》定稿为&quot;政策沟通、设施联通、贸易畅通、资金融通、民心相通&quot;。两处改动都非同小可：&quot;道路&quot;扩为&quot;设施&quot;，把港口、电网、光缆纳入射程，为后来的能源与数字合作预留了接口；&quot;货币流通&quot;改为&quot;资金融通&quot;，从汇率与结算问题扩展为包含开发性金融、股权投资的完整融资叙事。</p>\n<p>措辞变化反映的是实践倒逼：早期项目很快超出公路铁路范畴（中巴经济走廊一半以上投资在能源），单一货币议题也装不下亚投行这样的制度创新。阅读官方框架时做版本对比，往往比读任何解读文章都能更快定位真实重心的移动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"引力模型视角-为什么设施联通排在贸易之前\">引力模型视角：为什么设施联通排在贸易之前</h2><p>国际贸易的经验研究里最稳健的规律是引力方程：两地贸易量大致与经济规模成正比、与距离成反比。对数线性形式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln T_{ij} = \\alpha + \\beta \\ln (Y_i Y_j) - \\gamma \\ln D_{ij} + \\delta\\, BRI_{ij} + \\varepsilon_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是双边贸易额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_i Y_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是经济规模乘积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是经济距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BRI_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是倡议相关的连通变量。距离弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 在大量实证研究中稳定为负且绝对值不小——这正是&quot;一带一路&quot;全部物理投入的理论依据：修建中老铁路、开通中欧班列，本质上都是在压低有效距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>但压低距离需要先解决两个更靠前的约束：东道国是否允许（政策沟通），以及通道本身是否存在（设施联通）。这就是五通排序的经济含义——引力方程里的每一项都有它的前置条件，跳过前置直接谈贸易增长，就像不修路先发货车。2015 年《愿景与行动》把设施联通列为优先领域，与模型的提示完全一致。</p>\n<p>时间维度的证据同样支持这个顺序判断。以中老铁路为例：2021 年 12 月 3 日通车后，昆明—万象货运时间从约两天公路运输压缩至当天可达，老挝对华出口农产品随之放量——贸易流量的跃升严格发生在设施交付之后，而非战略文件签署之时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三届高峰论坛-五通的机制化进度条\">三届高峰论坛：五通的机制化进度条</h2><p>高峰论坛是观察五通机制化程度最好的标尺，因为每届成果清单都可逐项核验：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>届次</th>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>规模</th>\n<th>五通侧重的推进</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一届</td>\n<td>2017-05-14/15</td>\n<td>29 位外国元首和政府首脑与会，成果清单约 270 项</td>\n<td>融资指导原则、大写意铺开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二届</td>\n<td>2019-04-25/27</td>\n<td>37 位元首出席，成果清单 283 项</td>\n<td>债务可持续性分析框架、廉洁丝绸之路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三届</td>\n<td>2023-10-17/18</td>\n<td>151 国代表与 41 个国际组织参会，成果清单 458 项</td>\n<td>八项行动、机制化收口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>进度条的方向清晰可见：第一届重在铺规模，第二届开始补规则（财政部 2019 年 4 月发布《&quot;一带一路&quot;债务可持续性分析框架》、通过《廉洁丝绸之路北京倡议》），第三届以八项行动转向质量与机制。批评者会指出另一面——印度三届全部缺席、意大利 2023 年 12 月宣布不再续签合作备忘录，说明政策沟通层的共识并非只扩不缩。机制化的进度条与政治支持的波动并存，这才是完整的图景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"五通的短板分布-民心相通为何最难量化\">五通的短板分布：民心相通为何最难量化</h2><p>前三通都有硬指标可查：签署文件数、通车里程、班列开行列数、贷款余额。民心相通则长期依赖软性描述（文化年、留学生数量），这不仅是统计技术问题，更是结构性的：民心是前四通的因变量——当地居民对项目的态度，最终取决于征地补偿是否公道、就业是否兑现、环境是否受损，而不是文化演出了多少场。</p>\n<p>量化尝试已经出现。世界银行研究长期估计交通基础设施改善对减贫的贡献路径；第三方数据库如 AidData（威廉玛丽学院）给数万个中国海外项目标注了精确坐标，使研究者可以把项目选址与当地民意调查、经济数据匹配起来做因果推断。这类研究的中间结论值得注意：项目对当地收入的平均效应为正但异质性极大，负面案例集中于征地与环境纠纷密集的项目——恰好印证&quot;民生体验决定民心&quot;的结构判断。</p>\n<p>职业教育是当前最被看好的抓手之一。鲁班工坊自 2016 年起在多国落地（首个设在泰国大城技术学院），以设备加课程标准整体输出的方式培养本地技术工人；截至 2023 年已在二十多个国家和地区建成。它的价值在于把民心相通从&quot;观赏型交流&quot;改造为&quot;技能型嵌入&quot;——受训者进入的是使用中国设备的项目现场，交流与利益直接绑定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-把五通当并列清单刷\">反模式：把五通当并列清单刷</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>纠正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并列清单化</td>\n<td>忽视依赖顺序，出现无设施的贸易协定或无民心的基建</td>\n<td>先问前置条件是否满足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件数崇拜</td>\n<td>把签署合作文件数量当作实际进展</td>\n<td>追踪到项目级落地率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单通冒进</td>\n<td>跳过政策沟通强推项目，遭遇政权更迭风险</td>\n<td>意大利 2023 年退出即为例证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>民心工程化</td>\n<td>用演出展览代替利益分配改进</td>\n<td>以社区投诉与就业数据检验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>意大利的案例值得单独记取：2019 年 3 月 23 日作为首个七国集团成员签署谅解备忘录时，双方期待贸易投资拉动；2023 年 12 月梅洛尼政府宣布不再续签。四年间备忘录并未带来预期的投资跃升，而国内政治周期完成了翻转——这说明政策沟通层的&quot;签约&quot;只是许可的开始，若载体层与回报层迟迟不能兑现，许可本身会被收回。</p>\n<p>框架的价值最终要靠下游章节兑现：贸易畅通与资金融通如何落地为可度量的时间与成本，见<a href=\"../implementation-practice/trade-facilitation\">贸易便利化</a>与<a href=\"../implementation-practice/financial-cooperation\">金融合作</a>两篇的项目级拆账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>五通是有依赖顺序的操作系统：政策沟通提供许可、设施联通提供载体、贸易与金融提供回报与血液、民心决定维护成本</li>\n<li>初版&quot;道路联通、货币流通&quot;到定稿&quot;设施联通、资金融通&quot;的措辞扩展，记录了实践重心从交通向能源、数字与制度金融的移动</li>\n<li>引力方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln T_{ij} = \\alpha + \\beta\\ln(Y_iY_j) - \\gamma\\ln D_{ij} + \\delta BRI_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 解释了设施先行为何符合贸易经济学的基本规律</li>\n<li>三届高峰论坛成果清单显示机制化从规模铺设走向规则补课与质量收口，但印度缺席与意大利退出提示共识的双向波动</li>\n<li>民心相通是前四通的因变量，鲁班工坊式的技能嵌入比观赏型交流更能触及结构本质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"五通：一个有依赖顺序的合作操作系统","id":"五通-一个有依赖顺序的合作操作系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"文本考据：初版措辞与定稿的差异携带信息","id":"文本考据-初版措辞与定稿的差异携带信息"},{"level":2,"text":"引力模型视角：为什么设施联通排在贸易之前","id":"引力模型视角-为什么设施联通排在贸易之前"},{"level":2,"text":"三届高峰论坛：五通的机制化进度条","id":"三届高峰论坛-五通的机制化进度条"},{"level":2,"text":"五通的短板分布：民心相通为何最难量化","id":"五通的短板分布-民心相通为何最难量化"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：把五通当并列清单刷","id":"反模式-把五通当并列清单刷"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"丝路精神：一个历史概念的当代转译","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/strategic-vision/silk-road-spirit"},"next":{"title":"基础设施项目：从走廊骨架到项目账本","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice/infrastructure-projects"}}